0..77 Comment "// Operator declarations extend the module\'s operator table at a fixity and a"
78..154 Comment "// precedence, and a `rec` block holds definitions that call each other. The"
155..228 Comment "// lowering admits no operator declaration yet (#1111). A member claiming"
229..299 Comment "// descent on a call of another member is a `def rec`; these are plain"
300..341 Comment "// definitions, so each claim is refused."
